{"author":{"id":"89da5fec8eff6d69dbcdd68f81be7e9163b16f34b17e978ecf3554487379f453"},"ops":[{"type":3,"timestamp":1774129909,"nonce":"aRaDpXLdW1VRG7b/qoF0yBY0U74=","message":"**Per-prompt parameter snapshot: keyframe/delta model**\n\nStore parameter state only on the first message that uses a given configuration. Subsequent messages inherit until a change is detected (delta encoding).\n\nSchema sketch:\n- `message_params` table: `message_id`, `model`, `permission_mode`, `max_turns`, `max_cost_usd`, `preset_ids` (JSON), `allowed_tools` (JSON)\n- Only insert a row when the effective params differ from the previous message params\n- Query for message N: `SELECT * FROM message_params WHERE message_id \u003c= N ORDER BY message_id DESC LIMIT 1`\n\nThis avoids redundant storage (most messages in a row use the same config) while preserving full parameter traceability for the info popover.","files":null}]}